QuestGuidance.Register("en",431,{
[13761]="700088A0\n1\tReturn to Taskmaster Bárzqhosh at the Isendeep Mine\030Collect Grimwood-kindling (total: 10)\tKindling can be found in the Grimwood. Taskmaster Bárzqhosh tasked you with garnering enough wood to repair the picks used to pull ore from the Isendeep.\n",
[13762]="700173B3\n1\tTalk to Sigir at Anazârmekhem\030Collect dwarf-tools (quantity: see journal)\tThe Forges of Khazad-dûm lie to the south-west of Anazârmekhem. Sigir is disgusted that dwarf-tools are being used to forge the Orcs' weapons of war. He tasked you with rescuing the tools from their ignoble fate within the confines of the Forges of Khazad-dûm.\n",
[13763]="70053391\n1\tDestroy relic-hunting tools at Sharkey's Slough (0/10)\tRelic-hunting tools and dredging machine mechanisms can be found at Sharkey's Slough in the centre of the Gladden Fields. You have discovered that Sharkey's Men have been using a variety of tools in addition to Saruman's old dredging machines to search for lost relics in the Gladden Fields.\n2\tDestroy relic-hunting tools at Sharkey's Slough (total: 10)\030Destroy dredging mechanisms at Sharkey's Slough (total: 6)\tRelic-hunting tools and dredging machine mechanisms can be found at Sharkey's Slough in the centre of the Gladden Fields. You have discovered that Sharkey's Men have been using a variety of tools in addition to Saruman's old dredging machines to search for lost relics in the Gladden Fields.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have done much to hinder the efforts of Sharkey's Men in the Gladden Fields and destroyed the mechanisms of Saruman's dredging machines of old.\n",
[13764]="70001201\n1\tBring the Orc-tools to Avar\030Collect Orc-axes in Ongbishúk (total: 2)\030Collect Orc-picks in Ongbishúk (total: 4)\030Collect Orc-saws in Ongbishúk (total: 4)\tThe Orc-camp of Ongbishúk lies to the north-east of Gabilshathûr. Avar asked you to take the tools of the Orcs to help slow down their efforts to construct siege-weapons.\n",
[13765]="7003FE59\n1\tRecover tools (total: 8)\tThe tools should be recovered so the craftsmen can return to work.\n",
[13766]="7000A13B\n1\tCollect salamander-teeth (total: 8)\tSalamanders slither among the dunes and sands of the Barandalf, north and east of Dwaling. Mundaric Sandheaver wants you to defeat salamanders in the Barandalf and bring him their sand-crusted teeth.\n2\tBring teeth to Mundaric Sandheaver\tMundaric Sandheaver is at Dwaling. You have collected the teeth that Mundaric Sandheaver asked you to gather and have thinned the population of deadly salamanders that make dangerous the sands of the Barandalf. You should return now to him so he may study the teeth.\n",
[13767]="7002651D\n1\tDefeat Mangle-maw within the Circle of Fangs\tThe Circle of Fangs lies outside the caves in western Nan Curunír. Ondor has asked you to defeat the Warg pack-leader, Mangle-maw. Defeating a number of lieutenants in the Circle of Fangs may draw him forth.\n2\tTalk to Ondor in Nan Curunír\tOndor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunír. You should tell Ondor of Mangle-maw's defeat in the Circle of Fangs.\n",
[13768]="7003A05E\n1\tDefeat the Boar-tribe Orc-leader\tThe Boar-tribe leader is at their camp. You should defeat the Boar-tribe Orc-leader and send the Orcs into disarray.\n2\tDefeat the Boar-tribe Orc-leader\tThe Boar-tribe leader is at their camp. You should defeat the Boar-tribe Orc-leader and send the Orcs into disarray.\n3\tCompleted\tThe Boar-tribe Orc-leader has been defeated, creating confusion amongst the rest of the tribe.\n",
[13769]="70034A79\n1\tDefeat Graz\030Defeat Lârz\tDefeat the tormentors of Dale.\n",
[13770]="70025B76\n1\tTalk to Torogethir in Parth Aduial\tTorogethir's camp is along the road to the North Downs, east of Tinnudir and north of Ost Heryn. Orchalwë asked you to find Torogethir and help him in his efforts to solve the problems facing Ost Heryn.\n",
[13771]="7003715E\n1\tTalk to Dudsig\030Talk to Wilsig\030Talk to Tidric\030Talk to Sidnoth\tThe captains of the Toringas and their allies may be found at Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. Torferth has asked you to confront the captains of the Toringas and their allies and obtain their permission to search their belongings for evidence of treason.\n2\tThe belongings of the Toringas and their allies can be found throughout Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. Thane Torferth asked you to search the belongings of the Toringas and their allies for evidence of another traitor.\t\n3\tBring the evidence to Torferth at Tordag's camp\tThane Torferth is in Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. You should bring the evidence you found to Torferth for his review.\n",
[13772]="7003714D\n1\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild in the Mead Hall of Stoke\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, south-east of Tordag's camp. Torferth instructed you to return to Reeve Fríthild and let her know that the Torsbury garrison will be late coming.\n",
[13773]="70016D07\n1\tTalk to Águti in the Rotting Cellar\tÁguti is at the Rotting Cellar to the north. Águti will want to know you found a piece of the shattered statue.\n",
[13774]="700579A1\n1\tToss a coin to the journeywoman lutist\030Toss a coin at the adept harper\030Toss a coin to the adept flutist\030Toss a coin to the journeyman lutist\030Toss a coin to the bodhran minstrel\030Toss a coin to the journeyman harper\tNoisy minstrels wander about the Splintered Shield, keeping Ulthir awake. You should toss a coin to noisy minstrels in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Ulthir\tUlthir is trying to sleep it off in the bedchambers of the Splintered Shield. You should inform Ulthir that you've made the minstrels move on.\n",
[13775]="7002F983\n1\tDestroy Orc-totems at the western farmlands (total: 4)\030Destroy Orc-banners at the western farmlands (total: 4)\tOrc-totems and banners can be found around the farmsteads south of Cliving and west of the road. Captain Garmund has asked you to destroy many of the banners and totems the Orcs have placed across their sacked territory.\n2\tTalk to Captain Garmund outside of Cliving\tCaptain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving. Garmund awaits the results of your attempt to destroy the Orc symbols marking the precious farmlands beyond Cliving.\n",
[13776]="70008291\n1\tCollect Ongbúrz venom-pouches (total: 5)\030Defeat Ongbúrz Defiler\tThe Ongbúrz Orcs can be found in the ruins at Merenost, in southern Lin Giliath. Gandelin asked you to slay the Ongbúrz-defiler and return with the Ongbúrz venom-pouches.\n2\tTalk to Gandelin\030Collect Skirmisher's Venom-pouch (total: 5)\tGandelin is back at Lin Giliath. Gandelin asked you to slay the Ongbúrz-defiler and return with the Ongbúrz venom-pouches.\n",
[13777]="7001BFA5\n1\tTalk to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth\tFrideric the Elder is at Ost Guruth, north-east of Refr Quicksilver. Refr Quicksilver is concerned about the Orcs and Dourhands working together and thinks that the leader of the Eglain must be made aware of this development.\n",
[13778]="700304AB\n1\tUse a torch to burn the Watch-tower Súth-torr\tThe fallen Rohirrim watch-tower is in the north-east corner of their large encampment of Jóshkhin Orda to the north of North-torr. You should search for a torch near the watch-tower and burn it to drive out the evil that dwells there.\n2\tReturn to Guthferth at North-torr\tSergeant Guthferth is rallying the defences of North-torr just north of Floodwend, attempting to hold back the flood of Easterlings threatening to drown the Wold in chaos. You should speak with Sergeant Guthferth.\n",
[13779]="7002E5A3\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Egmund\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
